  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c11d8cbc-8700-4d9c-98b6-594b5f2ce684"],
 " count returns one representative. An integer count requests exactly that \
many distinct representatives and returns ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7af1ecf3-5125-4984-ae56-876463442a84"],
 " when too few exist."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"882d248a-c0e0-4e04-b4d2-43af34689a17"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<NextVertexFunction\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Identity"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "32b60b29-5466-4bbe-b0f9-7ee734e65bd9"],
